1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,236
The characters.

2
00:00:01,236 --> 00:00:13,190
Laxminarayan is the central comic figure: a bully at home and a slave at court, clever and quick, but with the courage of the frightened; he lies because he dares not tell the truth.

3
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:22,799
Jitman and Gore are the voice of the common people: they do the work and sleep on straw, and they turn out to be excellent weepers when their lives depend on it.

4
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:27,981
The king is young, absolute and easily moved by a show of loyalty.

5
00:00:27,981 --> 00:00:33,190
And the bull itself is dead from the start, the silent pivot of the plot.

